From 3ce3cd338c023452270dd2d00d0895d4346ff5af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Assistant <user@example.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Apr 2026 13:03:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat(web): instant-save settings, port fallback, CLI bare
 command resolution
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Web server now supports automatic port fallback (up to 10 ports) when
the configured port is occupied. WebTab UI rewritten to instant-save
mode — all changes take effect immediately without an Apply button.
CLI resolver gains bare command resolution on Windows via `where`,
resolving names like "claude" to full paths before detection.

Also includes knowledge index v2 updates, build script for MSI
bundling (copy-dist.cjs), and i18n additions for web settings.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>
